and someone over treacherously, or more generally, to be unfaithful to a person or cause. ID Y (5 points), Z (5 points), and A (5 points).", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:35Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Betray", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:36Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Treason?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:36Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Treason", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:36Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Treason?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:43Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Tradition", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:48Z", "username": "Yash Agrawal", "text": "Y: tradition", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: Y=tradition, Z=treason, A=betray, all from the Latin verb tradere", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:38:55Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "700 messages damn.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:39:01Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Lagta hai I missed something important", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:39:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Namrata ran a buzzing board here last night", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T14:39:40Z", "usernam